```python
text = input('Enter string: ')
freq = {}
for char in text:
    freq[char] = freq.get(char, 0) + 1

for key, count in freq.items():
    print(f"{key} : {'*' * count}")
```
This iteratively builds a frequency map, then dynamically generates a horizontal text bar chart representing the exact character distribution.
